        <activityName xml:lang="en">Cathode, aluminium electrolysis</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Cathode, aluminium electrolysis
na;
UUID: 24389f67-180d-3431-ae23-0198ab20232a
Includes cathode production and removal, transports of materials to the plant and the disposal of the wastes. Because the cathode is produced in the electrolysis plant, no cathode production plant is balanced. No data have been found on air emissions from baking. It is assumed that these emissions are included in the electrolysis.; Geography: Some Swiss datasets are used for European processes.
Location: Some Swiss datasets are used for European processes.
Technology: Average technology for the aluminium consumed in Europe (85% pre baked, 15% Söderberg
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature / Survey 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_24389f67-180d-3431-ae23-0198ab20232a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
